    {
      "Id": "3c9f3047-9ceb-4851-b237-476a518aa3e7",
      "Title": "How it works:\n- If you midi learn an encoder value - example: 48\n- The CC value 12 numbers above will control the encoder ring type - example: 56\n- This uses velocity to set the ring type - example: [1=Single], [2=Volume], [3=Pan] ",
      "Label": "Encoder Ring LED Assignment",
